// Buttons to the point-spend dialogs (#156) - each opens with no args needed, they read self directly.
// Graphic 2445/2445 (flat "paper tab" look, same id for both up/down states) and offsets
// match Erebor's own d_explevel bottom row exactly (scripts/experiences.scp) - the previous
// 2151/2152 checkbox-style graphic looked like a toggle, not an action button.
argo.button 70 260 2445 2445 1 0 1
argo.text 75 262 3 15
argo.button 185 260 2445 2445 1 0 2
argo.text 190 262 3 16
argo.button 300 260 2445 2445 1 0 3
argo.text 305 262 3 17

